('HCP-26-033', 125, NULL, 'Person Related', '512', 5, 'Phlebo showed improper communication etiquette on a client group. When he wasn’t getting a response, he repeatedly typed “?” on the group instead of escalating or checking internally. This behavior appears unprofessional and can damage the lab’s image. He needs to understand that client groups are for crisp, professional communication only — if there\'s a delay or confusion, internal coordination should be the first step.', 'Internal member making the company embarrassed infront of the client!', NULL, 512, 'Sorry sir I will be careful next time', 'Closed', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Training given by Aarish.', '2026-01-21 00:36:15', 0, NULL, 0, '2026-01-19 21:03:06', '2026-01-21 00:36:15', 'Pending', NULL, 'Training Need', 0, 0, 'Dr Vipul Bhasin', 'Hanzala Khan', 'Hanzala Khan', 'Center Phlebo', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0),
