(26, 'HCP-26-061', 'ANKITA', NULL, '[\"ignored_instructions\"]', NULL, 'The correct patient contact number is very important because it allows the hospital or clinic to communicate  with the patient. Accurate contact details help in appointment confirmations, test result notifications, emergency follow-ups, billing communication.Incorrect phone numbers can lead to missed appointments, delayed treatment, and difficulty contacting patients in urgent situations.', 'ANKITA', '2026-01-27', 'ANKITA', '1 DAY', NULL, '[\"performance_monitoring\"]', NULL, '2026-01-24 20:29:41', '2026-01-27 10:56:34', NULL, NULL, 95),
